export const STORY_PARAGRAPHS = [
  'ZU Developers began with a simple belief: a building is a promise. When a family trusts us with its plot, its home or its investment, we treat that trust as something we must keep. That belief comes from our founder, Javed Khan JD, who has spent more than 30 years in construction.',
  'Those years taught us that good construction is mostly small things done properly, every day. Checking levels, watching the quality of materials, keeping the site safe and tidy, and telling the client the truth, even when the news is not what they hoped for.',
  'We grew one project at a time. Today we have delivered more than 150 projects for over 100 happy clients, across Bhopal, Indore, Vidisha, Obaidullaganj and Asta, and 15 sites are being built right now.',
  'Our work covers what a project needs to be ready for people to live and invest in it: internal roads, drainage lines, boundary walls, entrance gates, landscaping and structures. You can see photos of each in our Project Library and in the gallery.',
  'The next generation is now part of the company. Directors and co-founders Umair Khan and Zaid Khan work alongside the founder, so ZU Developers has three decades of experience and fresh energy together. We are a family business, which means that when you work with us, you work with the people whose name is on the work.',
];

